  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was admitted to the orthopedic surgery service and \nwas taken to the operating room for above described procedure.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=1746-1872",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Please see separately dictated operative report for details.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=1874-1934",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The \nsurgery was uncomplicated and the patient tolerated the \nprocedure well.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=1935-2012",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Patient received perioperative IV antibiotics.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=2013-2059",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Postoperative course was remarkable for the following:",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=2061-2115",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "1.Hypotension->500 NS bolus with good effect",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=2117-2161",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Otherwise, pain was initially controlled with a PCA followed by \na transition to oral pain medications on POD#1.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=2163-2275",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient \nreceived lovenox for DVT prophylaxis starting on the morning of",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=2277-2353",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "POD#1.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=2355-2361",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The foley was removed on POD#2 and the patient was \nvoiding independently thereafter.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=2363-2448",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The surgical dressing was \nchanged on POD#2 and the surgical incision was found to be clean \nand intact without erythema or abnormal drainage.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=2449-2591",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s12",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient \nwas seen daily by physical therapy.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=2592-2640",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s13",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Labs were checked throughout \nthe hospital course and repleted accordingly.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=2641-2716",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s14",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "At the time of \ndischarge the patient was tolerating a regular diet and feeling \nwell.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=2717-2803",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s15",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was afebrile with stable vital signs.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=2805-2854",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s16",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The \npatient's hematocrit was acceptable and pain was adequately \ncontrolled on an oral regimen.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=2856-2952",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s17",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The operative extremity was \nneurovascularly intact and the wound was benign.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=18800417-DS-11:chars=2953-3030",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s18",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient's weight-bearing status is weight bearing as \ntolerated on the operative extremity with posterior precautions.",
